(card "exp:G-R2-1_luoyangchan_cap26M" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:G-R2-1_luoyangchan_cap26M"
  :body "---\nnav: 28\ntype: experiment\nid: G-R2-1_luoyangchan_cap26M\nshort_name: luoyangchan_cap26M\ntitle: \"G-R2-1 — 洛阳铲 solo, baseline_max_avg = 2.6M (2× anchor)\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: g\nround: r2\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_g__source_swap]]\"\ntrain_nav: 1.0595\ntrain_trade_count: 42\ntrain_win_rate: 0.6429\ntrain_sharpe: 4.5278\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0064\nval_nav_mean: 1.0054\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0093\nval_window_count: 9\ntest_nav: 1.0465\ntest_trade_count: 11\ntest_sharpe: 6.2969\ntest_win_rate: 0.7273\ntest_max_drawdown: -0.0065\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: demoted\noutcome: test_fail\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 1\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [source_swap]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: null\ncreated: 2026-05-17T01:30:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/g, round/r2, axis/source_swap, status/demoted, outcome/test_fail, leak/clean, size/small]\n---\n\n# G-R2-1 — 洛阳铲 + cap 2.6M\n\n> **TL;DR** —— R2 把 baseline_max_avg cap 放宽到 2.6M (2× anchor default 1.3M)，希望让更多洛阳铲 leg 通过 cap。train 42 笔, NAV 1.06。test 1.05 与 G-R1-1 完全相同 (洛阳铲 test 数据上 cap 触发 leg 同源)。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- G-R1-1 假设 cap 是洛阳铲 source 笔数低的瓶颈; R2-1 放宽 cap 试验。\n- 实测：trade_count 升到 42 (vs R1-1 27), 但 NAV 仅 1.06 —— 新接进来的 leg 大部分亏。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 同 G-R1-1, `baseline_max_avg=2,600,000`。152 raw signal → 186 post-ETF-blacklist → 46 post-cap.\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- 无 rolling. `#leak/clean`.\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 1.0595 | 42 | 4.53 | 64.3% | -0.64% |\n| Val (9w) | 1.0054 ± 0.009 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | 1.0465 | 11 | 6.30 | 72.7% | -0.65% |\n| **Δ test NAV vs anchor** | **-0.202 (FAIL)** | -9 | -0.85 | -2.3pp | -0.12pp |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 1; sample 稀。\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_g__G-R1-1__luoyangchan_solo]]\n- **competes_with**: [[arc_260516a__team_g__G-R2-2__luoyangchan_cap5M]], [[arc_260516a__team_g__G-R2-3__luoyangchan_nocap]]\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `team_g/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (G-R2-1)\n- `cross_team_test_nav_ranking_v2.csv` (G-R2-1 test 1.046)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- cap 放宽 trade_count 升但 win 降 (74% → 64%) —— cap 不是瓶颈，**source alpha density 才是**。\n- 这一系列 R2-1/R2-2/R2-3 共同 confirm: cap-relaxation 不能救 source swap failure。\n"
  :path "experiments/arc_260516a__team_g__G-R2-1__luoyangchan_cap26M.md"
  :source_mtime "2026-05-17T10:30:14+08:00"
